#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:149
msgid "Suitable for import into graph visualization tools like yEd."
msgstr "yEd などのグラフ可視化ツールへのインポートに適している。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:151
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "統計"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:161
msgid "Configuration Keys"
msgstr "設定キー"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:163
msgid "Customize behavior with these settings in `build.sbt`:"
msgstr "`build.sbt` で以下の設定により動作をカスタマイズできる:"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:165
msgid ""
"`dependencyTreeIncludeScalaLibrary := true`: Include Scala library "
"dependencies in output (default: `false`)."
msgstr ""
"`dependencyTreeIncludeScalaLibrary := true`: 出力に Scala ライブラリ依存性を"
"含める（デフォルト: `false`）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:166
msgid ""
"`dependencyDotNodeColors := false`: Disable colors in DOT node labels "
"(default: `true`)."
msgstr ""
"`dependencyDotNodeColors := false`: DOT ノードラベルの色を無効にする（デフォルト: "
"`true`）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:167
msgid ""
"`dependencyDotNodeLabel := (org: String, name: String, version: String) => "
"s\"$org:$name:$version\"`: Customize DOT node labels."
msgstr ""
"`dependencyDotNodeLabel := (org: String, name: String, version: String) => "
"s\"$org:$name:$version\"`: DOT ノードラベルをカスタマイズする。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:168
msgid ""
"`dependencyDotHeader := \"\"\"digraph \"custom\" { rankdir=\"TB\"; }\"\"\"`: "
"Set a custom DOT header."
msgstr ""
"`dependencyDotHeader := \"\"\"digraph \"custom\" { rankdir=\"TB\"; }\"\"\"`: "
"カスタム DOT ヘッダーを設定する。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:170
msgid "Related Tasks"
msgstr "関連タスク"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:172
msgid ""
"`whatDependsOn <module>`: Shows what depends on a specific module (e.g., "
"`whatDependsOn org.example:lib:1.0`)."
msgstr ""
"`whatDependsOn <モジュール>`: 特定のモジュールに依存しているものを表示する"
"（例: `whatDependsOn org.example:lib:1.0`）。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:173
msgid "`dependencyLicenseInfo`: Displays license information for dependencies."
msgstr "`dependencyLicenseInfo`: ライブラリ依存性のライセンス情報を表示する。"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:175
msgid "Scopes"
msgstr "スコープ"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-dependency-tree.md:177
msgid ""
"Available in `Compile` and `Test` configurations. Use `Global/` for cross-"
"configuration views if needed."
msgstr ""
"`Compile` と `Test` コンフィギュレーションで利用可能。必要に応じて `Global/` で"
"クロスコンフィギュレーション表示を行う。"
